 "description": "<p>Pituffik-Thule Air Base-DMI atmospheric monitoring station</p><p><a href=\"http://www.dmi.dk/groenland/vejret/byvejr/by/vis/GL/4202/Pituffik,%20Gr%C3%B8nland/\">Weather forecast</a></p><p><a href=\"http://www.dmi.dk/uploads/pics/klima_pituffik.png\">Climate</a></p><p class=\"bodytext\">Monitoring site for atmospheric composition.</p><p class=\"bodytext\">Station within the Network for the Detection of Atmospheric Composition Change (NDACC)</p><p>http://ndacc.dmi.dk/ndacc-dmi/pituffik/station-info/</p><p>http://www.ndsc.ncep.noaa.gov/</p><p>Station within the NASA Aeronet http://aeronet.gsfc.nasa.gov/</p><p>Laboratory space available for atmospheric studies.</p><table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\"><tbody><tr><td><p><strong>Instrument &amp; Period</strong></p></td><td><p><strong>Parameter</strong></p></td><td><p><strong>Cooperating Institutions</strong></p></td></tr><tr><td><p>DOBSON</p><p>2000 -</p></td><td><p>Column ozone</p></td><td><p>DMI, Denmark</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>FTIR Interferometer (Bruker) 1999 -</p></td><td><p>Column HCl, HNO3, ClONO3, HF, CFCs, CO &amp; GHGs, etc</p></td><td><p>NCAR, USA</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>LIDAR Aerosol/Temperature 1991 -</p></td><td><p>Aerosols Temperature</p></td><td><p>U. Rome, Italy</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>SONDE Aerosol</p><p>1992 - 1998</p></td><td><p>Aerosol profile</p></td><td><p>U. Wyoming, USA DMI, Denmark</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>SONDE Ozone Balloon</p><p>1991 -</p></td><td><p>Ozone, T/P, humidity and wind profiles</p></td><td><p>DMI, Denmark</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>UV-Vis SAOZ spectrometers 1990 -</p></td><td><p>Column NO2, Column Ozone</p></td><td><p>DMI, Denmark</p></td></tr></tbody></table><p>&nbsp;</p><div class=\"csc-default\" id=\"c9529\"><p class=\"bodytext\">NCAR:&nbsp; National Center for Atmospheric Research, Colorado, USA</p><p>WOUDC public data: <a href=\"http://www.woudc.org/data_e.html\"> http://www.woudc.org/data_e.html</a></p></div><p>&nbsp;</p>",
